# FishModLoader native renderer: shipped pipeline seed list (ARCHITECTURE-NATIVE 1.9, NR-02 initial version; NR-28 refreshes it from a full route).
# One pipeline key per line: <PROGRAM> <material key hex> [d]. Keys are normalised at load time (state without effect is dropped, dynamic
# depth/cull state is masked when the device supports it), so lines that normalise to the same pipeline cost nothing.
# Layout of the key: see render.state.MaterialKey. Regenerate from a run journal with the devtest command pipelineSeed.
